'''Nystullum''' was an [[Water|underwater]] [[city]] located beneath the northern ice floes of the [[planet]] [[Mon Cala]]. Prior to the [[Galactic Civil War]], the [[starship]] ''[[Profundity]]'' was the city's civic governance tower. Prior to joining the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]], [[Raddus]] served as [[mayor]] of the city.<ref name="ROUVG" />

